        "original_id": "78539607-3849-59e3-a7ad-bd7d3349cb03",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bryan Kocis, Harlow Cuadra, Joseph Kerekes, Brent Everett, Sean Paul Lockhart, Brent Corrigan, Bryan Phillips\n- Works and Companies: Schoolboy Crush, Cobra Video\n- Topics: gay pornographic film, murder conviction, life imprisonment\n\nFacts:\n- In 2004, Schoolboy Crush was released as a controversial gay pornographic film on Cobra Video.\n- Bryan Kocis directed Schoolboy Crush under the industry name Bryan Phillips.\n- Schoolboy Crush cast Brent Everett and Sean Paul Lockhart, and Sean Paul Lockhart used the stage name Brent Corrigan.\n- Harlow Cuadra and Joseph Kerekes, who were escorts, were charged with and convicted of Bryan Kocis' murder.\n- Harlow Cuadra and Joseph Kerekes were subsequently sentenced to life imprisonment without the possibility of parole.",
